abstract: >-
  Human labels, samples, rubrics, frozen analysis plans, analysis scripts and results for an audit of how often
  a checker-passing LLM repair of a web accessibility violation is not a real fix. Two blind labellers judged
  120 checker-passing AccessGuru-final repairs by GPT-4, Mistral and Qwen (main round), 120 in a pilot round,
  and 60 first-round repairs by five local models.
